This project builds on and includes the work of others:

kimodo.cpp (git submodule kimodo.cpp/), the GGML/C++ port of NVIDIA Kimodo,
Apache-2.0: https://github.com/Digital-Contraption-Labs/kimodo.cpp
  It in turn uses ggml (MIT), Eigen (MPL-2.0), JSON for Modern C++ (MIT) and
  NVIDIA Kimodo's MotionCorrection library (Apache-2.0); see kimodo.cpp/NOTICE.

three.js r160 and its GLTFLoader / BufferGeometryUtils (static/vendor/), MIT,
Copyright 2010-2023 Three.js Authors: https://threejs.org

MediaPipe Tasks Vision 1.1.1 with the pose and hand landmarker models
(static/vendor/mediapipe/), Apache-2.0, Copyright Google LLC; see
static/vendor/mediapipe/LICENSE and README.md (one local change: usage
logging disabled).

tools/motionbricks ports NVIDIA MotionBricks' SOMA in-betweening kernels to
numpy; MotionBricks itself and its ONNX model are downloaded separately.

Model weights are NOT part of this repository and are not covered by its
license. They are downloaded by the user and come under their own terms:
  - NVIDIA Kimodo SOMA / G1 models: NVIDIA Open Model License
  - NVIDIA Kimodo SMPL-X model: NVIDIA research-only license (no production
    use; Understudy refuses to share clips made with it)
  - Llama-3 text encoder: Meta Llama 3 Community License
  - NVIDIA MotionBricks and GEM-X: see their own repositories
